  <prompt>Build the Procedure and Procedure Version service of notes/procedure-and-file-model.md sections 3 and 8 and section 15 answers 1-2: create Procedures (each with its one rule set), create and copy-forward versions, publish, change dates, retire a version, and retire a Procedure through a named reconcile behind a read-only confirmation preview that selects Signals with the SAME method the D-170 sweep closes and counts only open invoices the caller can Read.</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in ASP.NET Core Minimal APIs, the Finance authorization filter, RuleSetService (076) and the Signals closure code (D-170).</role>

  <goal>Procedures and their versions are written only by the BFF under I-P1 to I-P5; a version's rules publish as policy versions keyed to it; retiring a Procedure switches its policies Off and closes their open Signals after a preview whose count can never exceed what the caller can see; every route refuses flagged-external callers first.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Model 3.1 (I-P1 to I-P5), 3.2 (columns), 5.1 (Procedure rows, step 0), 7.2 (re-key; v2 copies v1), 8.2 (no automatic re-check), 12 (019/076/077, D-170 rows), 15 answers 1-2 (preview rules, warning text). Code: RuleSetService (Services/Finance/RuleSetService.cs: edit creates a version :1296; publish refuses an earlier date :1628, end-dates the predecessor and moves sprk_currentversion :1720-1731; IsDraft :2082, Predecessor :2090; display readers :773, :2134). D-170 close: SignalClosureService (Services/Signals/SignalClosureService.cs): ClosePoliciesNotInForceAsync :130 (job sweep) and ClosePolicyRetiredNowAsync :85 both select with the private ReadOpenSignalsAsync(policyId) :403 and close with CloseAsync :358. The model cites :164-177, which is ReadPoliciesNotInForceAsync (which policies are Off), not the Signal selection. Caller rights: CallerRecordAccessProbe.GetCallerRightsForRecordsAsync (Infrastructure/ExternalAccess/CallerRecordAccessProbe.cs:346). Billing admin: BillingAdminAuthorization (Api/Finance/BillingAdminAuthorization.cs:26, D-76). Column names and option values: notes/080-*.md and notes/088-*.md.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="new">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Finance/Procedures/ProcedureService.cs</file>
      <file role="new">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Finance/ProcedureEndpoints.cs</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Finance/RuleSetService.cs (sprk_procedure on the set; version chain per (policy, Procedure Version); display readers)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Signals/SignalClosureService.cs (ontology-r1: one shared selection method)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Signals/PolicyVersionValidator.cs (ontology-r1: refuse sprk_procedureversion on Ontology-domain policies)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Dataverse/RecordCreatorPerson.cs, scripts/Set-ChildRecordCreatorPersonSchema.ps1, tests/scripts/Set-ChildRecordCreatorPersonSchema.Tests.ps1 (uac-r2: sprk_procedure, sprk_procedureversion)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/DI/FinanceModule.cs, Infrastructure/DI/EndpointMappingExtensions.cs (shared append points)</file>
